      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h2>Role</h2><p>An adversary’s role represents what kind of actions it takes during encounters.</p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Role</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Description</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Harrier</p></td><td><p></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Brute</p></td><td><p></p></td></tr><tr><td><p></p></td><td><p></p></td></tr><tr><td><p></p></td><td><p></p></td></tr><tr><td><p></p></td><td><p></p></td></tr><tr><td><p></p></td><td><p></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><h2>Rank</h2><p>The rank of adversary estimates their strength in battle and is part of the encounter-building guidelines.</p><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p>Rank</p></td><td><p>PC Count</p></td><td><p>Affinities</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Minion</p></td><td><p>1/2</p></td><td><p></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Standard</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Elite</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>2</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Solo/Apex/Champion</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>4</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>…</p><p></p>"
      },
